                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You are standing in an active specimen acquisition site. The family that mismanaged this preserve has been transitioned to alternative outcomes, and the parcel now performs. Pens. Counts. Every creature appraised, numbered, and filed."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "I run a string of sites off one clipboard. The Preserve is the quiet one - inventory that feeds itself, breeds itself, and appreciates while I sleep. The Company likes an asset that multiplies without a payroll."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Manager - the appraisal",
                    Label: "appraisal"
